\newlabel{fig:system}{{1}{5}{System level view. The two boards talk over the air using audible tones (squiggly red arrows). The master also has a Wi\,Fi link to a Cloudflare Worker that relays WebSocket traffic to a browser dashboard}{figure.caption.2}{}}
